* LTC4281 12 V hot-swap controller
.lib LTC4281.sub

VINPUT IN 0 12

* 10 mOhm current-sense resistor
RSENSE IN SENSE 10m

* External high-side N-channel pass MOSFET
M1 SENSE GATE OUT OUT NCHOTSWAP
.model NCHOTSWAP NMOS(VTO=3 KP=100 RD=2m RS=2m CGS=2n CGD=1n)

* Undervoltage/overvoltage qualification network
RUV1 IN UV 90.9k
RUV2 UV OV 2k
RUV3 OV 0 10k

* Fault timing capacitor and enable
CTIMER TIMER 0 100n
REN IN EN 10k

* LTC4281 pin order:
* VDD SENSE+ SENSE- GATE SOURCE DRAIN UV OV TIMER EN GND
XU1 IN IN SENSE GATE OUT SENSE UV OV TIMER EN 0 LTC4281

* Gate discharge and output network
RGATE GATE OUT 1Meg
COUT OUT 0 470u
RLOAD OUT 0 12

.tran 0 100m 0 10u startup
.meas tran vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM 80m TO 100m

.end
